### Feature ServiceOrderItems — GET (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: npm run dev:token -- admin  (o POST /api/sesion/login desde ISS-15)
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### GET ALL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ALL de una orden
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes?service_order_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
